# Membership summary

Members may terminate their membership in writing. The notice period for members is forty-five (45) days, counted from the day the written notice is received [[cite:obs-90ad1fbc0957d8dc56198ff26270bdfed151fd57 "Members may terminate their membership in writing. The notice period for members is forty-five (45) days, counted from the day the written notice is received."]].

The expense approval threshold is 500 EUR per single expense, effective from 1 October 2026 [[cite:obs-2792beca00e47de951ed7c12fac805146a98d101 "With effect from 1 October 2026 the expense approval threshold is 500 EUR per single expense."]].
